WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.051 --> 01:44.104
=Episode 15=

01:59.323 --> 02:02.952
♪Old photos, yellowed♪

02:03.304 --> 02:07.368
♪Timelines, tangled♪

02:08.072 --> 02:11.656
♪I boarded a rickety time machine♪

02:11.656 --> 02:14.856
♪Heart pounding, won't stop♪

02:15.048 --> 02:18.760
♪Old times, pass slowly♪

02:19.080 --> 02:23.336
♪In memories, the breeze is soft♪

02:23.848 --> 02:27.432
♪Your smile is like stars that shimmer♪

02:27.784 --> 02:33.224
♪Lighting up my lonely corner♪

02:42.650 --> 02:43.571
Any fish?

02:44.131 --> 02:44.691
No.

02:48.330 --> 02:49.330
I was just

02:49.330 --> 02:50.730
resting my eyes.

02:50.730 --> 02:51.571
I wasn't asleep.

02:52.091 --> 02:52.851
I know.

02:53.330 --> 02:54.170
Did I snore?

02:56.251 --> 02:57.971
How could you snore
while resting your eyes?

03:00.291 --> 03:01.131
You're right.

03:05.851 --> 03:08.291
Not a single fish bit?

03:09.096 --> 03:10.050
It moved a few times.

03:10.571 --> 03:11.571
If it moved,

03:11.571 --> 03:12.770
it means a fish was biting.

03:12.770 --> 03:14.650
When a fish bites, you need to reel in.

03:14.650 --> 03:15.571
Just reel it in.

03:15.571 --> 03:16.490
But you were asleep.

03:21.411 --> 03:22.251
No, if this keeps up,

03:22.251 --> 03:23.770
when will we ever catch a fish?

03:24.210 --> 03:24.770
I'm wondering

03:24.770 --> 03:25.730
if our spot isn't good.

03:25.730 --> 03:26.811
We should go deeper.

03:27.450 --> 03:28.811
There's no deeper place to stand.

03:29.811 --> 03:31.091
When will we catch something?

03:31.091 --> 03:32.571
Are there no big fish here?

03:33.450 --> 03:35.851
- It's fine.
- No, we can't just sit around and wait.

03:45.210 --> 03:46.811
Gao Haiming, look.

03:48.131 --> 03:48.691
You...

03:48.691 --> 03:49.851
I asked the resort owner

03:50.050 --> 03:51.011
for a net.

03:52.930 --> 03:54.011
I don't believe this.

03:54.411 --> 03:55.011
Be careful.

03:55.650 --> 03:56.232
You...

03:57.371 --> 03:57.992
I...

03:58.210 --> 03:58.890
Be careful.

03:59.531 --> 04:00.251
Trying to escape?

04:02.450 --> 04:03.091
Got it.

04:03.091 --> 04:04.170
Lucky I caught you.

04:04.691 --> 04:05.352
Thanks!

04:05.450 --> 04:06.650
- Come on.
- Come on. Easy.

04:09.730 --> 04:11.291
The oldest method remains the best.

04:18.290 --> 04:18.890
So?

04:19.090 --> 04:19.811
Realized the lake

04:19.811 --> 04:21.051
isn't so scary after all?

04:24.850 --> 04:26.890
Wasting time can be nice,

04:27.611 --> 04:29.011
but when it counts,

04:29.011 --> 04:30.371
my urgency gets things done.

04:30.371 --> 04:32.210
See? Now we've got dinner covered.

04:32.744 --> 04:33.650
How would you like it?

04:34.450 --> 04:35.371
Let's ask

04:35.371 --> 04:36.530
the resort chef to cook it.

04:36.931 --> 04:38.811
Maybe we could cook it ourselves.

04:44.210 --> 04:44.931
Here.

04:51.090 --> 04:52.890
I didn't expect you to know how to cook.

04:54.491 --> 04:56.090
There's more I can do.

04:56.371 --> 04:57.171
Like what?

04:58.850 --> 04:59.611
Like...

05:00.450 --> 05:01.611
You'll find out later.

05:05.691 --> 05:07.171
I saw you add the vegetables last

05:07.171 --> 05:08.330
when making the fish soup.

05:09.090 --> 05:10.450
That shows you cook often.

05:10.450 --> 05:11.251
Very experienced.

05:12.290 --> 05:14.011
But I am curious,

05:14.530 --> 05:16.051
why would a rich guy like you

05:16.770 --> 05:18.450
need to cook for yourself every day?

05:18.770 --> 05:20.371
My parents were busy when I was young,

05:21.530 --> 05:23.611
so I had to learn to cook.

05:23.811 --> 05:24.691
Here, try some.

05:32.611 --> 05:33.131
Is it good?

05:33.131 --> 05:33.970
It's tasty.

05:41.931 --> 05:42.611
What's wrong?

05:43.850 --> 05:45.171
A man who can cook

05:46.691 --> 05:47.530
is so handsome.

05:52.210 --> 05:53.611
Have more. There's plenty.

05:53.770 --> 05:54.371
Okay.

06:04.091 --> 06:05.410
(Unread Message)

06:05.410 --> 06:07.144
(Mr. Gao, everything's ready.)

06:07.144 --> 06:08.488
(Items arrive around 6:30 PM.)

06:08.488 --> 06:09.770
(Keep your phone nearby.)

06:09.890 --> 06:10.691
Something urgent?

06:11.491 --> 06:12.691
No, just Luo.

06:26.920 --> 06:27.491
By the way,

06:27.491 --> 06:28.931
when can we see the photos we took?

06:30.290 --> 06:31.251
After we get back,

06:32.051 --> 06:33.491
we can load them on the computer.

06:36.171 --> 06:38.530
That's really convenient, huh?

06:38.571 --> 06:39.251
Of course.

06:39.251 --> 06:40.410
Now that we have computers.

06:41.011 --> 06:41.770
Right?

06:42.330 --> 06:43.371
So advanced.

06:44.051 --> 06:44.811
What is it?

06:45.090 --> 06:45.770
A mosquito bite?

06:46.811 --> 06:48.171
Got me before I realized it.

06:50.330 --> 06:51.491
Here, I know a trick.

06:53.051 --> 06:54.931
When I got bitten as a kid,

06:55.410 --> 06:56.290
my grandma

06:56.290 --> 06:57.290
used this method.

06:58.344 --> 06:59.530
The pressing stops itching.

06:59.970 --> 07:00.691
Really?

07:02.450 --> 07:03.850
Well? Still itchy?

07:03.850 --> 07:04.410
Yes.

07:06.171 --> 07:06.931
I-I'll try again.

07:06.931 --> 07:07.931
A cross won't do, right?

07:07.931 --> 07:08.850
Maybe an asterisk.

07:09.371 --> 07:10.611
You need to press harder.

07:21.131 --> 07:21.691
Still itchy?

07:26.363 --> 07:29.448
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

07:32.424 --> 07:35.688
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

07:39.691 --> 07:40.931
I'm fine. Thanks.

07:42.051 --> 07:43.090
That method works well.

07:43.090 --> 07:44.171
I'll scratch it myself.

07:44.171 --> 07:48.744
♪I've become the center of the story♪

07:49.131 --> 07:51.450
How about we go back
and transfer the photos?

07:51.530 --> 07:52.131
Sure.

08:07.210 --> 08:08.611
It'll take 30 minutes?

08:08.611 --> 08:09.691
That long?

08:09.960 --> 08:11.016
(Copying 56 items from camera
to computer. 24% complete)

08:11.931 --> 08:13.011
That's very quick.

08:13.090 --> 08:14.171
Be patient.

08:15.650 --> 08:17.011
You'll soon be obsolete.

08:17.611 --> 08:18.290
Of course.

08:18.410 --> 08:20.210
You all will be obsolete too.

08:21.330 --> 08:22.210
Maybe.

08:22.450 --> 08:23.731
Who can say where future tech

08:24.051 --> 08:24.850
will lead?

08:28.731 --> 08:30.410
What do you think
the future will be like?

08:33.930 --> 08:35.650
I've heard some companies today

08:35.810 --> 08:36.770
are already researching

08:36.971 --> 08:38.611
more portable digital devices.

08:39.091 --> 08:40.611
Some even suggest

08:40.611 --> 08:42.371
that future phones might combine

08:42.371 --> 08:43.770
communication, photography,

08:44.091 --> 08:45.290
and even more features.

08:47.690 --> 08:48.890
This talk of yours

08:49.491 --> 08:51.331
would sound visionary

08:51.331 --> 08:52.731
if heard in 1999.

08:52.851 --> 08:53.570
But if people

08:53.570 --> 08:54.810
in 2025 heard it,

08:54.810 --> 08:55.851
they'd laugh at you.

09:00.011 --> 09:02.851
I just browsed online casually.

09:05.211 --> 09:06.491
But you speak as if

09:06.731 --> 09:08.170
you know 2025 very well.

09:11.491 --> 09:12.731
I'm just guessing.

09:13.131 --> 09:15.331
Technology advances so fast now.

09:15.331 --> 09:16.131
What you described

09:16.131 --> 09:17.331
will likely happen sooner.

09:19.570 --> 09:20.211
True.

09:22.824 --> 09:24.810
(New Message)
(Mr. Gao, I left air cans at your door.)

09:24.810 --> 09:25.530
(Take them in.)

09:26.810 --> 09:28.091
Work this late?

09:28.971 --> 09:30.851
No. How could that be?

09:36.971 --> 09:37.971
I need to take this call.

09:38.888 --> 09:39.451
Hello?

09:39.451 --> 09:40.530
Your super deluxe package

09:40.530 --> 09:41.170
is at the door.

09:41.170 --> 09:42.491
Can you come sign for it?

09:43.650 --> 09:44.290
Okay.

09:44.530 --> 09:45.290
I'm coming now.

09:47.371 --> 09:49.770
Well, Luo said
he's delivering documents.

09:50.050 --> 09:50.971
I'll go get them.

09:51.731 --> 09:52.410
Watch this.

09:52.410 --> 09:53.170
Keep it connected.

09:53.451 --> 09:54.290
Okay, go ahead.

10:00.731 --> 10:01.530
(54% complete)

10:01.530 --> 10:03.290
This is so slow.

10:32.104 --> 10:33.320
(67% complete)

10:42.050 --> 10:42.731
Luo Zhou,

10:43.570 --> 10:44.971
I can't believe you.

11:08.091 --> 11:09.170
So that's it.

11:14.251 --> 11:16.371
You could've just asked
for a photo together.

11:28.731 --> 11:29.331
(Fondness: 69.9%)

11:29.331 --> 11:31.211
(Why stuck at 69.9%)

11:31.211 --> 11:32.131
(for so long?)

11:32.810 --> 11:34.491
(If fondness reaches 100%,)

11:35.170 --> 11:36.611
(will I return then?)

11:37.050 --> 11:38.890
(Then I'd never see him again?)

11:46.491 --> 11:47.290
Luo Zhou,

11:48.770 --> 11:50.331
you're good at turning everything

11:50.810 --> 11:51.930
into chaos.

12:33.650 --> 12:35.410
Stop. Give back my air cans.

13:10.251 --> 13:10.851
Hello?

13:11.011 --> 13:11.570
Mr. Gao,

13:11.650 --> 13:12.930
the reservation is for 7:30 PM.

13:12.930 --> 13:14.131
Only three minutes are left.

13:14.290 --> 13:15.011
Hurry over.

13:15.011 --> 13:16.050
Or you'll miss it.

13:16.211 --> 13:17.251
Our booked slot

13:17.331 --> 13:18.371
expires soon.

13:18.491 --> 13:19.491
Anything else?

13:19.851 --> 13:21.170
Boss, you got this.

13:21.530 --> 13:22.731
I'm on standby.

13:23.011 --> 13:24.410
I'm your strongest backup.

13:25.491 --> 13:27.491
We'll talk properly when I'm back.

13:28.890 --> 13:30.170
Wait. Hello?

13:35.011 --> 13:36.371
Hello? Where are you?

13:36.650 --> 13:37.491
I'm by the river.

13:38.211 --> 13:39.211
Come out. You'll see me.

13:58.428 --> 14:01.960
♪Old photos, yellowed♪

14:02.440 --> 14:06.376
♪Timelines, tangled♪

14:07.208 --> 14:10.888
♪I boarded a rickety time machine♪

14:10.888 --> 14:13.832
♪Heart pounding, won't stop♪

14:14.152 --> 14:17.864
♪Old times, pass slowly♪

14:18.184 --> 14:22.408
♪In memories, the breeze is soft♪

14:23.091 --> 14:24.570
(Is he finally confessing?)

14:25.650 --> 14:26.890
(Why now?)

14:27.570 --> 14:29.251
(Why no system alert?)

14:34.731 --> 14:35.451
Huan'er.

14:39.211 --> 14:39.971
Huan'er.

14:49.251 --> 14:49.930
I...

14:52.890 --> 14:54.251
Well, I...

14:54.491 --> 14:55.050
It...

14:56.491 --> 14:58.131
You must've checked
the weather forecast,

14:58.371 --> 15:00.530
knowing
there's a Leo meteor shower tonight.

15:00.770 --> 15:01.851
You turned off the lights

15:02.050 --> 15:03.930
to watch the meteor shower with me.

15:04.770 --> 15:05.851
How romantic.

15:06.530 --> 15:09.770
Yes, because it's easier to see them
when the lights are out.

15:09.770 --> 15:10.371
Right.

15:30.091 --> 15:31.570
Such beautiful fireworks.

15:50.611 --> 15:51.170
Huan'er.

15:51.451 --> 15:52.810
Darling, will you marry me?

15:53.011 --> 15:57.930
- Marry him!
- Marry him!

15:57.930 --> 15:58.760
- I do.
- Marry him!

15:58.760 --> 15:59.810
- Marry him!
- Marry him!

16:26.251 --> 16:27.170
I'm sorry, Huan'er.

16:27.731 --> 16:29.131
I wanted to surprise you.

16:29.131 --> 16:31.170
But I ruined everything.

16:32.170 --> 16:32.770
I...

16:38.611 --> 16:39.731
Actually,

16:41.570 --> 16:44.410
perfection is life's biggest taboo.

16:47.611 --> 16:49.251
We can't always chase perfection.

16:50.251 --> 16:51.530
Look at the moon.

16:51.851 --> 16:53.050
Once it becomes full,

16:53.851 --> 16:55.050
it immediately starts waning.

16:56.371 --> 16:57.290
So,

16:57.650 --> 16:58.930
don't always expect

16:58.930 --> 17:00.050
a perfect moment.

17:00.810 --> 17:02.170
I believe

17:03.810 --> 17:05.370
timing trumps ceremony.

17:06.610 --> 17:07.891
Cherish the present.

17:09.171 --> 17:10.530
Actually, every moment

17:11.850 --> 17:13.171
is the best moment.

17:14.651 --> 17:16.731
Don't you agree, Gao Haiming?

17:33.171 --> 17:33.891
Huan'er.

17:48.090 --> 17:49.050
Actually, I...

17:58.130 --> 18:00.610
Answer it. What if it's important?

18:08.011 --> 18:08.651
Hello?

18:08.971 --> 18:10.411
Boss, did it work?

18:11.810 --> 18:12.491
Luo Zhou,

18:12.891 --> 18:14.251
why are you still at the office?

18:15.130 --> 18:16.491
It's better to be important.

18:17.330 --> 18:18.050
Boss, this time,

18:18.050 --> 18:19.530
I do have something important.

18:19.530 --> 18:21.130
Mr. Zhang from Huasheng Supermarket

18:21.672 --> 18:23.171
wants to meet you tomorrow morning.

18:23.171 --> 18:24.411
He's flying to Paris at noon,

18:24.891 --> 18:26.330
so you might need

18:26.330 --> 18:27.691
to come back tonight.

18:27.971 --> 18:28.770
Got it.

18:55.130 --> 18:56.971
Well, about Xinye yesterday,

18:56.971 --> 18:58.411
things are progressing smoothly.

18:58.530 --> 18:59.130
Really?

19:00.651 --> 19:01.290
Good.

19:13.570 --> 19:14.610
You have mints?

19:14.610 --> 19:15.290
Want one?

19:15.651 --> 19:16.171
Sure.

19:20.290 --> 19:21.050
Another one.

19:28.330 --> 19:29.251
Never mind.

19:29.370 --> 19:30.411
Y-You don't eat that.

19:35.451 --> 19:36.530
Then let's listen to music.

19:37.130 --> 19:37.736
Okay.

19:44.491 --> 19:46.130
(I really want to confess to her.)

19:46.130 --> 19:47.370
(But every time I get ready,)

19:47.370 --> 19:48.330
(something comes up.)

19:48.610 --> 19:49.691
(I don't want this either.)

19:49.931 --> 19:50.731
(Sir,)

19:50.971 --> 19:52.251
(you can't even confess.)

19:52.251 --> 19:53.610
(How will you marry her later?)

19:54.130 --> 19:55.011
(I don't want this.)

19:55.171 --> 19:56.411
(I prepared for days.)

19:56.411 --> 19:57.576
(But at the last minute...)

19:59.411 --> 20:00.451
(Here's a song to you.)

20:00.451 --> 20:02.090
(Love Really Needs Courage.)

20:09.691 --> 20:10.370
Well...

20:11.130 --> 20:12.411
I'm so sleepy.

20:12.411 --> 20:13.891
I'll take a quick nap.

20:38.931 --> 20:40.530
I'm good from here.

20:44.072 --> 20:45.330
You can come in late tomorrow.

20:48.251 --> 20:49.130
Get some rest.

20:50.130 --> 20:52.330
You rest early too.

21:08.987 --> 21:11.970
♪Entwined worries linger♪

21:13.179 --> 21:15.950
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

21:17.851 --> 21:23.764
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

21:25.561 --> 21:28.621
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

21:29.787 --> 21:33.239
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

21:34.411 --> 21:36.770
This is the air of destiny.

21:36.931 --> 21:38.850
There are 33 cans in total.

21:44.330 --> 21:45.171
This is for you.

21:46.651 --> 21:47.370
What is it?

21:48.411 --> 21:49.850
Don't open it yet.

21:51.090 --> 21:53.451
Open it at the right moment.

21:58.780 --> 22:02.290
♪If I could♪

22:02.290 --> 22:04.011
(Fate will bring romance and you)

22:04.610 --> 22:06.090
(to me together.)

22:06.908 --> 22:11.272
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

22:11.323 --> 22:14.056
(Heart rate: 69.9%)

22:14.491 --> 22:15.651
70%.

22:15.651 --> 22:16.691
(Heart rate: 70%)

22:16.691 --> 22:18.050
(Heart rate: 70.1%)
70.1%.

22:18.570 --> 22:19.931
(Heart rate: 70.2%)
70.2%.

22:20.411 --> 22:21.931
(Heart rate: 70.3%)
70.3%.

22:21.979 --> 22:25.960
(Heart rate)

22:26.191 --> 22:27.651
(Heart rate: 70.8%)
What's happening?

22:27.651 --> 22:28.370
(Fondness: 70.9%)

22:28.370 --> 22:28.891
No way.

22:29.530 --> 22:30.931
(Heart rate)
70.9%.

22:40.570 --> 22:42.931
(This is the air of destiny.)

22:43.570 --> 22:46.130
(Made by the fresh air of Lake Como.)

22:48.731 --> 22:53.032
(It represents the wish of sharing
the same breath of air with each other)

22:53.448 --> 22:56.011
(at every single moment.)

23:10.651 --> 23:11.290
Actually...

23:12.610 --> 23:14.691
Actually, I prepared a lot for today.

23:15.290 --> 23:16.530
72%.

23:16.610 --> 23:17.891
But man proposes, God disposes.

23:18.290 --> 23:19.411
All those air cans

23:19.610 --> 23:20.931
were taken by the cleaning lady.

23:21.290 --> 23:22.891
The LED strip I prepared went off.

23:25.330 --> 23:26.891
It seems everything reminds me

23:26.891 --> 23:28.488
today isn't the right day to say this.

23:30.770 --> 23:31.731
I almost wonder...

23:31.931 --> 23:32.770
I almost wonder

23:33.171 --> 23:34.770
if saying that would bring

23:35.411 --> 23:36.731
the whole building down,

23:36.731 --> 23:38.130
and the moon with it.

23:41.530 --> 23:42.211
But...

23:44.011 --> 23:44.891
But what if?

23:52.104 --> 23:53.290
What if the building stands

23:55.330 --> 23:56.451
and the moon stays put?

24:13.610 --> 24:14.290
Huan'er,

24:15.891 --> 24:16.770
I like you.

24:25.288 --> 24:28.392
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

24:31.400 --> 24:34.408
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

24:37.480 --> 24:41.128
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

24:42.888 --> 24:48.104
♪I've become the center of the story♪

24:48.808 --> 24:53.370
♪I must escape this dream♪

24:54.824 --> 24:59.552
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

25:00.520 --> 25:04.424
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

25:04.744 --> 25:06.920
♪A fake world♪

25:07.624 --> 25:12.616
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

25:16.290 --> 25:17.130
Huan'er, I...

25:17.832 --> 25:18.536
- I'm sorry.
- I...

25:18.536 --> 25:19.251
No.

25:32.050 --> 25:33.891
(The fondness is rising too quickly.)

25:34.530 --> 25:35.770
(If this continues,)

25:36.491 --> 25:38.530
(the time I can stay here
will get shorter,)

25:40.370 --> 25:41.891
(and I'll never see him again.)

25:58.408 --> 26:00.584
(The air of destiny)

26:09.171 --> 26:10.130
What's wrong?

26:10.491 --> 26:12.691
You returned from the business trip
looking soulless.

26:15.931 --> 26:18.491
It's nothing. I'm sick.

26:19.290 --> 26:20.530
I'm quite sick.

26:20.850 --> 26:22.290
This time, it might be incurable.

26:25.130 --> 26:26.330
You don't have a fever.

26:28.411 --> 26:29.130
You know nothing.

26:29.130 --> 26:32.011
I just mean... I'm really sick.

26:34.130 --> 26:35.770
Are you overtired from work?

26:36.171 --> 26:37.651
Talk to Gao Haiming...

26:40.330 --> 26:41.370
Don't mention that name.

26:44.130 --> 26:45.050
What are you doing?

26:45.570 --> 26:46.451
I'm looking

26:46.451 --> 26:47.691
at this comic I drew before.

26:48.011 --> 26:49.810
The one where you're the inspiration

26:50.290 --> 26:51.411
for the female lead

26:51.411 --> 26:52.850
inhabited by another soul.

26:53.011 --> 26:54.491
I even took your advice.

26:54.610 --> 26:57.011
Made her a time traveler
from the future.

26:58.931 --> 27:00.770
So where is the plot now?

27:00.931 --> 27:03.251
She and her true love
are head over heels for each other.

27:03.251 --> 27:05.011
She's about to confess
everything to him.

27:06.171 --> 27:07.011
That fast?

27:07.130 --> 27:09.451
So they've decided to be together?

27:10.891 --> 27:13.011
Even though
they didn't quite see eye-to-eye before,

27:13.251 --> 27:15.530
and they lacked mutual understanding
on many things,

27:15.770 --> 27:18.130
as they got to know
and trust each other,

27:18.451 --> 27:20.050
they gradually discovered

27:20.330 --> 27:21.891
many precious qualities in the other.

27:22.090 --> 27:24.290
That sparked the most genuine love
between them.

27:25.090 --> 27:26.130
Isn't that romantic?

27:27.411 --> 27:29.530
Then what about the ending?

27:29.691 --> 27:30.731
The ending is definitely

27:30.731 --> 27:32.530
that the female lead stays in this world

27:32.530 --> 27:34.050
and stays forever with the male lead.

27:35.651 --> 27:36.370
What?

27:36.370 --> 27:39.211
So she will just abandon
her family and friends

27:39.211 --> 27:40.731
and her career in her own world?

27:40.931 --> 27:41.891
For a romance

27:41.891 --> 27:42.530
and a man,

27:42.530 --> 27:44.130
she decides to stay here forever?

27:44.130 --> 27:45.251
Is she crazy?

27:45.810 --> 27:48.971
Huan'er, it's just a story I made up.

27:50.810 --> 27:51.370
Oh, right.

27:52.491 --> 27:53.651
Maybe I got too into it.

27:55.370 --> 27:56.251
Let's skip that.

27:57.251 --> 27:59.610
By the way,
that music producer wanted you

27:59.810 --> 28:01.370
to enter that competition, right?

28:01.610 --> 28:02.491
Have you decided?

28:05.050 --> 28:07.891
I don't have much confidence
in that competition.

28:08.290 --> 28:10.211
Mengmeng, you can do it.

28:10.211 --> 28:11.370
Trust me.

28:11.491 --> 28:12.971
I trust you.

28:13.651 --> 28:15.491
But you can't predict the future.

28:15.610 --> 28:16.290
Forgotten?

28:16.290 --> 28:17.810
My predictions are spot on.

28:18.050 --> 28:18.610
Listen.

28:18.610 --> 28:20.891
Whatever the outcome
of the competition for you,

28:20.891 --> 28:22.090
you will achieve your dream

28:22.090 --> 28:23.610
because of the competition.

28:26.090 --> 28:27.931
Then predict for Hu Tiehan and me.

28:28.971 --> 28:30.770
Mengmeng, I really don't get it.

28:30.971 --> 28:32.610
What's so great about Hu Tiehan?

28:32.610 --> 28:33.891
Why are you so hung up on him?

28:33.891 --> 28:34.891
Is he really the one?

28:36.050 --> 28:37.931
I don't know
what's so great about him either.

28:38.171 --> 28:39.810
He's just a silly goose,

28:40.050 --> 28:41.130
a blockhead.

28:41.130 --> 28:42.810
Every time I drop hints,

28:42.810 --> 28:44.451
he seems completely oblivious.

28:44.850 --> 28:45.491
But, Huan'er,

28:45.491 --> 28:46.931
do you understand that feeling?

28:47.211 --> 28:49.251
When he approaches me,

28:49.451 --> 28:51.731
my heart just blooms,

28:53.971 --> 28:56.411
with butterflies taking flight.

28:56.850 --> 28:57.691
Do you get it?

28:58.090 --> 28:59.570
Are you silly?

29:00.370 --> 29:01.810
You've led the way for so long

29:02.050 --> 29:03.610
and taken so many steps toward him.

29:04.211 --> 29:05.971
He's only taken the tiniest step
toward you.

29:05.971 --> 29:07.610
And you think it's all been worth it?

29:08.050 --> 29:09.570
I've liked him for eight years.

29:10.451 --> 29:12.130
If he didn't feel anything
for me at all,

29:12.130 --> 29:14.011
there's no way
I could've lasted this long.

29:16.370 --> 29:17.050
Huan'er,

29:18.011 --> 29:19.171
I can truly feel

29:19.171 --> 29:20.651
his sincerity and hesitation.

29:21.570 --> 29:23.211
But you can't be together.

29:23.211 --> 29:25.171
Why can't we be together?

29:25.570 --> 29:26.251
Because...

29:29.011 --> 29:30.731
(I have two chances left
to share spoilers.)

29:32.610 --> 29:33.691
(But I have to tell her.)

29:34.691 --> 29:35.691
Listen to me.

29:39.370 --> 29:40.731
You will get together.

29:41.651 --> 29:42.971
You'll love each other deeply.

29:43.370 --> 29:45.330
You'll share a time of great happiness

29:45.330 --> 29:46.850
and wonderful joy.

29:48.370 --> 29:51.850
But in the end,
he'll die in the line of duty.

29:53.211 --> 29:54.330
If that's the case,

29:55.451 --> 29:57.211
do you still choose to be with him?

29:58.651 --> 30:01.640
♪Entwined worries linger♪

30:04.290 --> 30:05.691
If that's truly the case,

30:07.290 --> 30:09.330
then having been happy together
is enough for me.

30:11.931 --> 30:12.810
Warning! Warning!

30:13.290 --> 30:15.171
You can't reveal spoilers
to any characters.

30:15.530 --> 30:17.770
The system punishment
has been triggered,

30:18.090 --> 30:19.491
resulting in time rewinding.

30:20.050 --> 30:20.971
Reminder again.

30:21.130 --> 30:22.810
Don't reveal spoilers
more than five times.

30:23.090 --> 30:24.931
Remaining chances: one.

30:31.931 --> 30:35.336
♪If I could♪

30:35.731 --> 30:36.850
I can truly feel

30:36.850 --> 30:38.530
his sincerity and hesitation.

30:40.156 --> 30:42.536
♪Hearing two hearts♪

30:42.536 --> 30:46.696
♪Beating together♪

30:48.171 --> 30:48.731
Mengmeng,

30:50.211 --> 30:53.931
you will be incredibly happy.

30:57.011 --> 30:57.850
You have my word.

31:18.428 --> 31:19.651
(Letao Tower)

31:19.651 --> 31:21.610
Regarding the issues
everyone just raised,

31:21.931 --> 31:23.330
I'll compile them for Dr. Wei.

31:23.810 --> 31:24.931
Over the next month,

31:24.931 --> 31:26.211
we'll streamline

31:26.610 --> 31:27.731
and upgrade the product.

31:28.290 --> 31:30.251
We aim to launch the new product
early next year.

31:31.251 --> 31:31.850
Okay.

31:32.971 --> 31:33.610
Everyone.

31:34.770 --> 31:35.570
The R&D department's

31:35.570 --> 31:37.130
new project's plan and implementation

31:37.130 --> 31:38.610
require your full cooperation.

31:39.050 --> 31:40.850
All priorities align with R&D's plan.

31:45.130 --> 31:45.810
Anything wrong?

31:47.850 --> 31:49.370
Then execute. Dismissed.

32:01.640 --> 32:02.411
(Huge Sale! Clearance Prices!)

32:02.411 --> 32:04.130
Its texture is completely skin-friendly.

32:04.370 --> 32:06.050
(Sale)
And we've conducted numerous tests.

32:06.050 --> 32:07.691
It will definitely not harm your skin.

32:07.850 --> 32:08.971
All individually wrapped.

32:09.050 --> 32:09.691
Very convenient.

32:09.704 --> 32:10.632
(Tender Care, Angel for Women)
Look.

32:10.850 --> 32:12.810
Then give me a day-use
and a night-use pack.

32:13.330 --> 32:13.931
Day and night.

32:14.130 --> 32:14.971
Okay, no problem.

32:15.850 --> 32:17.451
Can I get a black plastic bag?

32:18.330 --> 32:18.984
Sure.

32:19.484 --> 32:21.768
(Sale! Tender Care, Angel for Women)

32:22.171 --> 32:24.130
Actually, menstruation

32:24.130 --> 32:25.971
is a perfectly
normal biological process.

32:26.171 --> 32:28.050
It shows our bodies are healthy.

32:28.370 --> 32:30.090
There's nothing to be ashamed of.

32:30.090 --> 32:30.651
Right?

32:32.090 --> 32:32.810
Here, two extra.

32:33.050 --> 32:33.570
Thank you.

32:34.011 --> 32:34.931
Check out over there.

32:35.130 --> 32:35.971
Okay, thanks.

32:41.491 --> 32:42.090
Hello, Mr. Gao.

32:42.651 --> 32:43.211
Hello.

32:53.731 --> 32:54.451
Hello, Mr. Gao.

32:55.850 --> 32:57.290
Are you here to inspect the work?

32:57.704 --> 32:58.330
No.

32:58.691 --> 32:59.850
Just off work and free.

32:59.850 --> 33:00.691
Thought I'd drop by.

33:02.731 --> 33:04.211
No worries. Sales are good today.

33:04.211 --> 33:04.850
Rest assured.

33:06.370 --> 33:07.090
Okay.

33:13.651 --> 33:15.770
Let's grab dinner together after work.

33:16.090 --> 33:16.712
No.

33:18.290 --> 33:20.130
It's just that I have a lot to do today.

33:20.651 --> 33:23.770
I need to clear some inventory later

33:24.130 --> 33:25.691
and then compile some reports.

33:25.931 --> 33:27.011
It's fine. I can wait.

33:27.251 --> 33:27.891
No, don't.

33:28.251 --> 33:29.211
If you're swamped,

33:29.211 --> 33:30.251
I can have Marketing...

33:30.251 --> 33:31.211
No need, really.

33:31.330 --> 33:32.251
Don't get anyone else.

33:32.251 --> 33:32.971
I can do it.

33:33.451 --> 33:34.610
I don't trust others to.

33:34.810 --> 33:35.570
Some things

33:35.570 --> 33:37.090
j-just have to be done by me.

33:38.770 --> 33:40.691
If there's nothing else...

33:41.050 --> 33:42.211
I am quite busy here.

33:43.810 --> 33:45.411
Okay, I'll let you get back to work.

33:47.547 --> 33:51.850
(Sale! Tender Care, Angel for Women)

33:51.850 --> 33:52.691
Bye, Mr. Gao.

33:59.491 --> 34:01.370
(I just don't want it
to happen so fast.)

34:02.251 --> 34:03.731
(Why can't you get it?)

34:09.072 --> 34:12.055
♪Entwined worries linger♪

34:13.264 --> 34:16.035
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

34:17.936 --> 34:23.849
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

34:25.646 --> 34:28.706
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

34:29.872 --> 34:33.324
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

34:34.320 --> 34:39.846
♪Until the world's end♪

34:42.256 --> 34:46.052
♪If I could♪

34:46.640 --> 34:49.456
♪Keep loving you♪

34:50.480 --> 34:52.880
♪Hearing two hearts♪

34:52.880 --> 34:57.796
♪Beating together♪

34:58.768 --> 35:02.632
♪If I could♪

35:02.632 --> 35:05.872
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

35:06.928 --> 35:14.253
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

